  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAF: MIAGI&apos;s deltagande 17 dec, Sida</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAF: MIAGI&apos;s particiaption 17 Dec, Sida - RAF: MIAGI&apos;s particiaption 17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det svenska bilaterala samarbetet med sju l&#xE4;nder kommer att slutf&#xF6;ras i december 2013. Under en dag av seminarier kommer Sida att granska resultatet och potentialen i de relationer som byggts upp genom akt&#xF6;rssamverkan. MIAGI har bjudits in f&#xF6;r att underh&#xE5;lla denna dag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish bilateral cooperation with seven countries will be finalized and come to an end in December 2013. During a day of seminars Sida will review the performance and potential of the relations built through Partner Driven Cooperation. MIAGI has been invited to perform this day.</narrative>
  </description>
